mbient light (windows, open garage door, overhead lighting).\n</p>\n<p class=\"note\"><strong>Best for:</strong> the most recommended balance of price + visual pop.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<span class=\"pill blue\">Premium 4K</span>\n<h3>Maximum Detail</h3>\n<p class=\"note\">\nThe sharpest experience—cleaner UI, crisper text, and maximum course detail for the “high-end bay” look.\n</p>\n<p class=\"note\"><strong>Best for:</strong> “forever bay” builds and golfers who care about image clarity.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
